  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the secondment of UK Officials from Her Majesty&#x2019;s Revenue and Customs (HMRC) to the African Tax Administration Forum (ATAF) to assist ATAF to build and strengthen its capacity and build sustainable expertise in the long term.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support the secondment of UK Officials from Her Majesty&#x2019;s Revenue and Customs (HMRC) to the African Tax Administration Forum (ATAF) to assist ATAF to build and strengthen its capacity and build sustainable expertise in the long term.  is a component of Regional and International Tax Initiatives (RITI)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;232,489. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
